  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:656b31bb854a8982660300b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员室的话，已经\n打扫完毕了哦。\n…呵呵，您注意到了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f47aae73b47560b16ed8da11620917cbc374d0b1e46312271dd72202620f2d13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c6d08f1021ea0deb7c5ca13",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想推荐的蛋糕店\n太多了…那个…如果您愿意的话，\n能一起去挑选就好了…",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e3fa65e818c441389535f491bc7c5d5eb174512332c199178ce482c658141a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0684b3bb72d40c50d0d8c3b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小时候的您是什么样的人呢\n遇见了谁，知晓了什么…\n如果可以的话请讲给我听。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d91b0b1bd4a852f9f33ed713b0b37c6ef43bc26cb5e1c276351f6ccf280b5505",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63cb3f12e1bb3e45c459b3f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了不擅长阳光的我，父母在\n生日时送给了我面纱…虽然几次\n更换了新的，但回忆是永恒的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6266fa561eb40bca332433b341b979f0b12668e53b894e62a3337ba1ade716df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a6eb3e77c2da1a9ef7b9d74",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日时，总会思考自己与生俱来的\n本性…但是，已经\n不痛苦了。因为有您在",
      "source_fingerprint": "f601a919a2056ccd98cc5618733913cf8cc46f7edea8705ea2f81b29198ccc98",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a09644f7111c6fe93db81b2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有给您的通知…\n要一起打开看看吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "79c1f3656d7f83b359b54dcfd120fe37060be59b89e19f47b687e58d7eb0d91d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a4f1ca3f091805970cb8835",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "似乎有礼物送到了呢\n拆开的乐趣…呢。呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4f895d7959cee5a742929b1c42962b3d60260410d648daef7f317f6eee624fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c36dbe698b04afb2d335aa2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "似乎有达成的任务呢\n呵呵，辛苦您了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0786a967cb7d1cff567aba3665f4715749e35b36b3f2580f5e621ba036854fb0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e7b6128c2b77270f7663195",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "似乎要举办活动了。\n…那孩子也开始躁动了…",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e8399def5dec4a9ca5540e8a6a14223bffbe5caa21f13ba17a9c706827b4c92",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8698b2892bea056d57009b0f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动似乎很热闹。\n沉迷过度的话…必须注意\n不要展现出不得体的模样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca60c69f5d8e693e618b58971adf6ca75071add9d0bb672337f2a50c7a04e8a1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1405fc3040efd48936aa11af",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让他逃掉了…",
      "source_fingerprint": "3da9c40405bc61cea7d7e79e61aaba3a1fc8f14acc5be3edac6ca2fd3ec7b6c6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fff97eaa46076d4c5addb9a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘名鉴的等级\n似乎提升了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4fb966cca1b710da0cdc59e58afcf4d6487cfce3938483ec701be7e0460b62b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08e369cd7dac09c54870c81d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "深色能聚集阳光，保护肌肤\n…这件衣服，是非常\n可靠的伙伴呢…",
      "source_fingerprint": "619bffab1d6e6a2af026a49d3e6120fc4777cb88570856c33ee9d2eff0fc91ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3ca4dbc95361d12fcd847b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "尽量找了长款的衣服…\n如果是便于奔跑的服装…\n可能会唤醒那孩子吧…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "327231b98ceaa46ddef309e2c5cfa84c2750b28921035840b823f2f20a25ac29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8d6ebccb183ace69dd80805",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件衣服、装了点心和\n咖啡的篮子…还有阳伞…\n休息日的三件套呢。呵呵",
      "source_fingerprint": "d476ad3a44e6cc54606cbbd1301469b2d22a107d00fb25e1aeee27885182c9d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6184038dc0b85a798191736a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不够不够…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "579b6daee8af14a5d74190ec4b6ac140f3164017a072b15dbcc1dce8ab980af2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b70569fdaf7595b7da40bb55",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吃饱了…",
      "source_fingerprint": "f21ab7cb4ad6462bd64bd232fed0e86265894a3ccba188043e1c70ec8cf3c8e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c6a3361ae606c6e89149bb6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让他逃掉了…",
      "source_fingerprint": "3da9c40405bc61cea7d7e79e61aaba3a1fc8f14acc5be3edac6ca2fd3ec7b6c6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e53359b980182e7a16df525",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还不够还不够…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "252084006d8b0a1cbe4b38d46d39497239039055a1f031e65ca7560a830b0474",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2954d5fa7312a99346700a3e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊啊，至高无上的味道…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a15c07b90be7e1ae5364b023b47bcb5c347012e4648a105ad0f5ccdbf8a426ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c740ed80f03ad4efdf2652b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最美味的孩子…是我的东西。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce8e876af7b7fe53d0f953fddc273c10a663203597354b61dbe25ea0011330d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c50eb0703b5c2129c0f9434c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf78b80a061534c8d73ee4d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今夜，也是磨砺獠牙的时刻\n到来了…",
      "source_fingerprint": "01220b20ccae9074e3ab5315091479c6cc6bf696dd95ba76841d1977c882a151",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0313ce87fe02bb4c3aebf50c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "学园的历史故事…\n真是令人心潮澎湃呢…",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea500727bcaa4790ceffe4b3601386d699c7eec110969376e70ab507ba0dab16",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fceba14b125f8ce4d6162e83",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比赛…吗？\n…有吗？美味的对手…",
      "source_fingerprint": "08fecc6802b4c1305920038b75438aa4ddd67bc4215ef6782b3d042fab98e9f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3eb4ce6a5ae736260c256906",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘，Pretty Derby！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb83cf4ef414ba1498ca22eb71c89743df595040a09f9d503fb2e9db9beca0d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4d83ca092c5105126e2f5b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "沸腾、燃烧…啊啊…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9937a42e0345d9fe07ab364c37a30dfe1d43399d43e9dc9b78535a714d6b1bbb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "120000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee14f45c0f94e8b12f44ab94",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可恨的人…",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e3c809406547fe2120b4c952387c22b26a2bbd301020fd8d89cecefa31c3a36",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "1241"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d116f9ee27dbe57e7ab71f67",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "魔物的同类。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e50c845cc25480c6dec6c87cdc888f4f8990d4edd05fcf4d2c917b3b4bb7667",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "1242"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afe54450b205cb2165ec854c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的登录奖励\n似乎是这个。",
      "source_fingerprint": "094872d2c5e8b99a005fa2e12e93e84a645eacfc5d6defcbfb43a1042e2076ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:031f7953512ad70eee5a29ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会守护着您。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5edac699661da7bbfd11c3d0bdc9f9837392a499fb001ca54a77280f69eca24d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "140000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c965a69473ebf720f9e6132d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "您真厉害。",
      "source_fingerprint": "66c95d86ff70bd3aaac0c2748aa343bd7cbcc294ac9895d90d9f45235e3e8863",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "140001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f322de37029de73de4c00a0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀…",
      "source_fingerprint": "d17809827b0889e5a0b80dbad0f7eef8501c7ca15d5376b38cd26eaa7264a2e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "140002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2187d65f3877aedea03b5cea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真不愧是您呢…♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3037069c88f62816898c1e48138f679c86b244e4079e6abee8992940258c9a72",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "140003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a0572a9f8ba346862774282",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是漂亮。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c4731874e8dce5947497524bffc2ae65b0fb92aa592a3435724b2940633d426",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "140004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8af4fc3c38b0453fab3ae321",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "支援未能及时…",
      "source_fingerprint": "cea27f47bcda2d905580519f5a777b5474a203ebe8b9634dc431f3d5f9a0dee3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "140005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d42bdfbf56d1a5c134e656e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真不愧是您呢…♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3037069c88f62816898c1e48138f679c86b244e4079e6abee8992940258c9a72",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "140006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ada325871944e8bda61a6bd1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是漂亮。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c4731874e8dce5947497524bffc2ae65b0fb92aa592a3435724b2940633d426",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
